Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:23.19,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\move(1492,588,1492,-4)\fnDFHannotateW7-A\c&H34364F&\frz21.65\bord3\3c&HF5F5F5&}查明当前位置
