Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.92,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.6,140.8)\fnHYQiHei 75S\fry10\fscx140\fs84\c&HF70E9A&\clip(838.4,46.4,1187.2,107.2)}机器子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.29,0:19:45.42,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.6,140.8)\fnHYQiHei 75S\fry10\fscx140\fs84\c&H514942&}机器子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:45.54,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.6,140.8)\fnHYQiHei 75S\fry10\fscx140\fs84\c&HC3C1BF&}机器子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.92,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.6,140.8)\fnHYQiHei 75S\fry10\fscx140\fs84}机器子
